### Resumo financeiro
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/financial/summary?month=9&year=2026
Accept: application/json

### Movimentos do mes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/financial/movements?month=9&year=2026
Accept: application/json

### Registrar entrada de teste
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/financial/incomes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentType": "CPF",
  "tenantName": "Inquilino Teste",
  "documentNumber": "529.982.247-25",
  "propertyRegistration": "IM-001",
  "transactionDate": "2026-09-27",
  "grossAmount": 1500.00
}

### Registrar saída/despesa de teste
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/financial/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Manutenção Elétrica e Pintura",
  "propertyRegistration": "IM-001",
  "transactionDate": "2026-09-28",
  "grossAmount": 320.50
}

### Excluir transação por ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/financial/transactions/1
